{"id":"60af01126d249179","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-beta-model.md","title":"Beta Model Correctness","display":"df-beta-model — Beta Model Correctness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-beta-model","aliases":["62-df-beta-model"],"display":"df-beta-model — Beta Model Correctness","depends_on":["[[62-df-omega-model]]","[[62-df-L2-model]]","[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition I.5.3; Chapter VII introduction","source_pages":[18,243],"source_pdf_pages":[36,261]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-beta-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-beta-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-beta-model — Beta Model Correctness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" href=\"?note=5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" title=\"62-df-omega-model\">62-df-omega-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"087811585401a368\" href=\"?note=087811585401a368\" title=\"62-df-L2-model\">62-df-L2-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition I.5.3; Chapter VII introduction"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18</span><span>243</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>36</span><span>261</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S}\">\\(\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" href=\"?note=5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" title=\"62-df-omega-model\">62-df-omega-model</a> 的 ω 结构；满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"087811585401a368\" href=\"?note=087811585401a368\" title=\"62-df-L2-model\">62-df-L2-model</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_1(S_2)\">\\(\\Sigma^1_1(S_2)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a>；赋值的变量域见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_*=(\\mathbb N,\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N),+,\\cdot,0,1,&lt;)\">\\(\\mathcal M_*=(\\mathbb N,\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N),+,\\cdot,0,1,&lt;)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beta\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Beta}(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{OmegaStruct}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S})\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Sigma^1_1(S_2)\\forall g_N:V_N\\to\\mathbb N\\forall g_S:V_S\\to\\mathcal S\\\\\n&amp;\\quad[\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S},(g_N,g_S)\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal M_*,(g_N,g_S)\\models\\varphi].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beta\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Beta}(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{OmegaStruct}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S})\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Sigma^1_1(S_2)\\forall g_N:V_N\\to\\mathbb N\\forall g_S:V_S\\to\\mathcal S\\\\\n&amp;\\quad[\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S},(g_N,g_S)\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal M_*,(g_N,g_S)\\models\\varphi].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>量化赋值表达“允许来自模型的数、集合参数”。空集合域候选的 Beta 规定为假；满足关系只在 OmegaStruct 成立时调用。通过否定得到同样的 Π¹₁ 正确性。β 正确性比标准一阶部分更强：它保证树有路径、编码序非良基等 Σ¹₁ 见证不会全部缺失。未把 Beta 定义成 Π¹₁-CA₀ 的满足关系；这是两种不同性质。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition I.5.3; Chapter VII introduction；纸面页 18, 243；PDF 页 36, 261。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-omega-model","status":"resolved","id":"5ed7a378ff9d39c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-omega-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2-model","status":"resolved","id":"087811585401a368","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8535a715d3193fba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-omega-model","status":"resolved","id":"5ed7a378ff9d39c6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S}$ 为 [[62-df-omega-model]] 的 ω 结构；满足关系见 [[62-df-L2-model]]；$\\Sigma^1_1(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；赋值的变量域见 [[62-df-L2]]。$\\mathcal M_*=(\\mathbb N,\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N),+,\\cdot,0,1,<)$。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2-model","status":"resolved","id":"087811585401a368","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","exce